# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-Platform Support:** Installs Wireguard tools using `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Pacman>`__ on Arch Linux and `apt <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/APT_(software)>`__ on Ubuntu/Debian."
msgstr "**Suporti Shumë-Platform:** Instalime Wireguard Instrumentë `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Pacman>`__ në Arch Linux dhe `apt <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/APT_(software)>`__ në Ubuntu/Debian."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-distro:** Supports Debian, Ubuntu (``apt``), Arch Linux (``pacman``), and Fedora/EL (``dnf``) via distro-specific task files."
msgstr "**Shumë-distro:** Mbështet Debian, Ubuntu (``apt``), Arch Linux (``pacman``), dhe Fedora/EL (``dnf``) nga."

