# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall's SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to `/saml/acs` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak's realm descriptor by [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a `.onion` issuer is unresolvable directly. `/auth` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** është SuiteCRMHyrja e tij SAML kundër Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` në [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml))Jo një prokurë para saj. Kërkesat e paautifikuara goditën pikën e hyrjes së firewallit SAML të Simfonit, e cila ridrejton Keycloak; pohimi kthehet në `/saml/acs` dhe vendos një të vërtetë SuiteCRM Sesioni, pra aplikacioni jep kontrollin e vet të identifikuar UI duke përfshirë kontrollin e tij të ndërprerjes. Llogaritë janë krijuar në hyrjen e parë nga pohimi (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), dhe certifikata e nënshkrimit IdP lexohet nga KeycloakPërshkrimi i mbretërisë nga [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) në çizme, mbi Tor STLS proxy sa herë që pronari është një qepë, sepse një `.onion` Çanteri është i paprekshëm direkt. `/auth` Qëndron i arritshëm si hyrje lokale e xhamit të thyer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM’s own SAML login against Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** është SuiteCRMSAML ka hyrje kundër Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` në ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` Qëndron i arritshëm si hyrje lokale e xhamit të thyer."

