msgid "Owns `_MERGED_DOMAINS_CACHE`. Public API: `get_merged_domains`. The domain map is intentionally derived from the applications view rather than living in a parallel top-level overrides path. Per-app domain declarations live in `applications.<app>.domains` and flow through the regular applications-merge pipeline."
