# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is the single point of truth for the release pins of the lint tools that the toolchain installs from GitHub releases: [actionlint](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint), [hadolint](https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint) and [shfmt](https://github.com/mvdan/sh)."
msgstr "Ky rol është pika e vetme e së vërtetës për siguresat e veglave lint të instaluara nga GitHub: [instrumenti](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint). [hadolint](https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint) dhe [shfmt](https://github.com/mvdan/sh)."

