# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/01_admin.yml`](./tasks/01_admin.yml) provisions only the administrator in Shopware's user table. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `services.sso.flavor: oidc`, so no oauth2-proxy fronts the role and the storefront carries no authenticated surface at all; the Keycloak login provider that [`tasks/setup/oidc.yml`](./tasks/setup/oidc.yml) configures covers the administration backend alone. `biber` therefore has no account in any matrix variant and [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` unconditionally."
msgstr "[`tasks/01_admin.yml`](./tasks/01_admin.yml) në ShopwareTavolina e përdoruesit. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) kunjat `services.sso.flavor: oidc`, kështu që nuk ka oauth2-Proxy fronts the roll and the store front has no actualed head at all; the Keycloak Furnizues hyrjeje [`tasks/setup/oidc.yml`](./tasks/setup/oidc.yml) Konfigurimet mbulojnë vetëm backendn e administratës. `biber` në çdo dhe [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Perkthen `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` Pa kushte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) seeds only the administrator into Magento's admin table (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, credentials from [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); `biber` reaches the backend solely through the oauth2-proxy declared in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that proxy is absent and `biber` has no native account, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `administrator` persona keeps its native login via `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` and runs in every variant."
msgstr "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) në MagentoTabela admin (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, Kredenciale nga [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)). `biber` arrin backend vetëm përmes oauth2- Proksi deklaroi brenda [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)- Në `services.sso.enabled: false` është dhe `biber` Nuk ka llogari vendase, kështu që [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Perkthen `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. `administrator` Personi mban hyrjen e tij vendase nëpërmjet `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` Dhe shkon në çdo variant."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) creates the account with `tootctl accounts create` and never sets or captures a password, so `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — the Keycloak secret — cannot drive Mastodon's native `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` has no Mastodon account at all, since the OIDC sign-in ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The SeaweedFS companion scenario ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) drives the same admin journey and skips on the same flag."
msgstr "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) Krijon llogarinë me `tootctl accounts create` dhe kurrë nuk vë apo nuk kap një fjalëkalim, kështu që `ADMIN_PASSWORD` ⇩ the Keycloak Nuk mund t'i japësh makinës fshehurazi. Mastodonështë vendas `/auth/sign_in`. `biber` nuk ka Mastodon Të gjitha llogaritë, që nga shenja OIDC ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) është e vetmja rrugë që mund të krijojë një të tillë. Në `services.sso.enabled: false` është shtegu [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Perkthen `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` dhe `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. SeaweedFS Skenari shoqërues ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) Drejton të njëjtin udhëtim dhe kalon në të njëjtin flamur."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) runs after `update.php`. It includes the shared gateway consumer contract, then reads both globals back out of the running container with `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` and asserts the provider, the base URL and the model, so an unconfigured surface cannot reach a green deploy."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) shkon mbas `update.php`. Ajo përfshin kontratën e përbashkët të konsumit, pastaj lexon të dy globalet përsëri jashtë konteinerit që punon `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` dhe pohon ofruesin, URL bazë dhe modelin, kështu që një sipërfaqe e pakonfiguruar nuk mund të arrijë një vendosje jeshile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) creates a dedicated non-superuser owner (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, unusable password) plus its own workspace, and binds the endpoint to that pair."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) Krijo a (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, Fjalëkalimi i papërdorshëm) plus hapësirën e vet të punës, dhe lidh pikën e fundit të këtij çifti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) waits for the ExApp heartbeat, registers the deploy daemon and the ExApp (route `^/mcp`, verbs `POST,GET,DELETE`, access level `1`), enables the ExApp, mints an app password for the dedicated MCP account via `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, persists it through `sys-token-store` under `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, and asserts that an authenticated `initialize` call answers `200`."
