msgstr "🔎 Mbaje të vogël, të qartë dhe të thirrur pikët nga `make`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔎 Poll external systems until expected artifacts are ready"
msgstr "🔎 Sistemet e jashtme të sondazhit deri në objektet e pritshme janë gati"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔐 **Optional OAuth2 Proxy access guard:** [OAuth2 Proxy](https://oauth2-proxy.github.io/oauth2-proxy/) can be layered in front of Taiga when you want proxy-level access control in addition to Taiga's own authentication flow."
msgstr "🔐 **OUth opcional2 Proxy** [OAuth2 Proxy](https://oauth2-proxy.github.io/oauth2-proxy/) është përpara Taiga në TaigaAutentifikim i vetë."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔐 **Optional OAuth2 Proxy access guard:** `OAuth2 Proxy <https://oauth2-proxy.github.io/oauth2-proxy/>`__ can be layered in front of Taiga when you want proxy-level access control in addition to Taiga’s own authentication flow."
msgstr "🔐 **OUth opcional2 Proxy** `OAuth2 Proxy <https://oauth2-proxy.github.io/oauth2-proxy/>`__ është përpara Taiga në TaigaAutentifikimi përmban rrjedhje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔐 **SSO with OIDC & LDAP** (optional)"
msgstr "🔐 **SSO me OIDC & LDAP** (Zgjedhja)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔐 **SSO/Authentication Plugins:** OpenID Connect, LDAP, GitHub, GitLab and more."
msgstr "🔐 **Plugin:** OpenID Connect, LDAP, GitHub, GitLab Dhe më shumë."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **LDAP direct login (Option A, default off):** [`taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext`](https://github.com/Monogramm/taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext) enables users to log into Taiga directly with their LDAP credentials via the Taiga login form. Settings are appended to `config.py` at container startup."
msgstr "🔑 **Hyrja direkte LDAP (Opsioni A, hiq):** [`taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext`](https://github.com/Monogramm/taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext) mund të futen përdoruesit Taiga direkt me kredencialet e tyre LDAP vila Taiga Forma e hyrjes. Rregullimet janë shtuar në `config.py` në fillim të kontenierit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **LDAP direct login (Option A, default off):** ```taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext`` <https://github.com/Monogramm/taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext>`__ enables users to log into Taiga directly with their LDAP credentials via the Taiga login form. Settings are appended to ``config.py`` at container startup."
msgstr "🔑 **Hyrja direkte LDAP (Opsioni A, hiq):** ```taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext`` <https://github.com/Monogramm/taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext>`__ enables users to log into Taiga directly with their LDAP credentials via the Taiga login form. Settings are appended to ``config.py`` në fillim të kontenierit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **Let’s Encrypt Integration**"
msgstr "🔑 **Lejon integrimin e Kriptonit**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **Let’s Encrypt Integration**   Pulls in challenge configuration and CAA-record management for automatic certificate issuance and renewal."
msgstr "🔑 **Lejon integrimin e Kriptonit** Nxit konfigurimin e sfidës dhe menaxhimin e CaA-së për lëshimin dhe përtëritjen e certifikatës automatike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **OIDC login via Keycloak (Option B, default on):** [`taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`](https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth) enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom `taiga-front` image with the frontend plugin built in (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Without the custom frontend image the SSO button will not appear in the UI."
msgstr "🔑 **Hyrja OIDC nëpërmjet Keycloak (Mundësia B, e prezgjedhur në):** [`taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`](https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth) lejon SSO nëpërmjet Keycloak → LDAP. **Shënim:** Plugin OIDC nuk është publikuar në PyPI dhe kërkon një porosi `taiga-front` figurë me në (KafeScript/Gulp). Pa imazhin e zakonshëm SSO nuk do të shfaqet në UI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **OIDC login via Keycloak (Option B, default on):** ```taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`` <https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth>`__ enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom ``taiga-front`` image with the frontend plugin built in (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Without the custom frontend image the SSO button will not appear in the UI."
msgstr "🔑 **Hyrja OIDC nëpërmjet Keycloak (Mundësia B, e prezgjedhur në):** ```taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`` <https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth>`__ enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom ``taiga-front`` figurë me në (KafeScript/Gulp). Pa imazhin e zakonshëm SSO nuk do të shfaqet në UI."

